      "content": "wait, what do u mean by \"goblinkin's gambit\"? and what are these \"tiny army of goblins\" you're talking about? i just wanted to understand the math behind the interest calculation, not a game or anything. can you just stick to the actual numbers and focus on the calculation part?",
